 2)^{2} &= 31 + 1 - 16 \\\\\n(x - 1)^{2} - 4(y - 2)^{2} &= 16 \\\\\n((x - 1)^{2})/(16) - ((y - 2)^{2})/(4) &= 1\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the center is $(1,2)$." 13194139534602 false] [17592186083121 1020 #edb/ref 17592186298161 13194139534602 true] [17592186083121 1020 #edb/ref 17592186298168 13194139534602 true] [17592186083121 1020 #edb/ref 17592186298198 13194139534602 true] [17592186083121 1020 #edb/ref 17592186298204 13194139534602 true] [17592186083208 1020 #edb/ref 17592186298147 13194139534602 true] [17592186083208 1020 #edb/ref 17592186298181 13194139534602 true] [17592186083209 1020 #edb/ref 17592186298154 13194139534602 true] [17592186083209 1020 #edb/ref 17592186298186 13194139534602 true] [17592186083209 1020 #edb/ref 17592186298209 13194139534602 true] [17592186083210 1020 #edb/ref 17592186298175 13194139534602 true] [17592186083210 1020 #edb/ref 17592186298193 13194139534602 true] [17592186083210 1020 #edb/ref 17592186298216 13194139534602 true] [17592186083845 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534602 true] [17592186083845 1100 "What is the center of the hyperbola $((x + 4)^{2})/(7) - ((y - 2)^{2})/(6) = 1$?" 13194139534602 false] [17592186083845 1100 "What is the center of the hyperbola $\\frac{(x+4)^{2}}{7}-\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{6}=1?$" 13194139534602 true] [17592186083845 1145 "The equation of a horizontal hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nNote that the given equation can be rewritten as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-(-4))^{2}}{7}-\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{6}=1\n$$\n\nIn this case, $h=-4$ and $k=2.$\n\nTherefore, the center of the hyperbola is $(-4,2).$" 13194139534602 true] [17592186264030 1000 #edb/ref 17592186298192 13194139534602 true] [17592186298147 1017 #edb/ref 17592186298148 13194139534602 true] [17592186298147 1089 "q-116086" 13194139534602 true] [17592186298147 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534602 true] [17592186298147 1100 "What is the center of the hyperb